  "guide.problem.roles.title": "I am not getting bigger roles",
  "guide.problem.roles.subtitle": "Find out whether the block is stats, reputation, team, auditions, or timing.",
  "guide.problem.roles.search": "castlink auditions agent acting jobs bigger role",
  "guide.problem.roles.what": "Bigger roles usually need a stronger full profile, not just one lucky application.",
  "guide.problem.roles.why": "Casting looks at talent, fame, reputation, preparation, past work, team support, and current availability together.",
  "guide.problem.roles.now1": "Open CastLink and compare role requirements against your current stats.",
  "guide.problem.roles.now2": "Use Team if representation is weak or missing.",
  "guide.problem.roles.now3": "Take smaller clean roles when they build reputation and credits.",
  "guide.problem.energy.title": "Energy keeps stopping me",
  "guide.problem.energy.subtitle": "Understand why some actions are expensive and how to plan the week.",
  "guide.problem.energy.search": "energy tired rest stamina blocked week",
  "guide.problem.energy.what": "Energy is a weekly planning limit, so heavy actions can block other choices until the next week.",
  "guide.problem.energy.why": "Career, studio, training, social, and personal actions compete for the same short-term attention.",
  "guide.problem.energy.now1": "Choose the most important outcome for this week before spending energy.",
  "guide.problem.energy.now2": "Avoid starting several demanding actions if your energy is already low.",
  "guide.problem.energy.now3": "Use lower-pressure apps when you are preserving energy for a major commitment.",
  "guide.problem.health.title": "Health alerts feel too frequent",
  "guide.problem.health.subtitle": "Understand prevention, clinic treatment, and when a condition needs attention.",
  "guide.problem.health.search": "health medical clinic wellness care flu cold pain injury sick treatment",
  "guide.problem.health.what": "Minor issues can appear from low health, weak body, burnout pressure, or career stress. Serious conditions still need proper treatment.",
  "guide.problem.health.why": "Care Team can prevent or quietly handle small problems, but active medical conditions use Health Clinic so treatment choices still matter.",
  "guide.problem.health.now1": "Hire Care Team support if small issues are interrupting your weeks too often.",
  "guide.problem.health.now2": "Use Health Clinic when an active condition is already lowering your health cap or work momentum.",
  "guide.problem.health.now3": "Treat repeated pain, injuries, or illness before they become chronic or public.",
  "guide.problem.money.title": "Money or business is confusing",
  "guide.problem.money.subtitle": "See the difference between cash, loans, business income, stocks, and long-term value.",
  "guide.problem.money.search": "money cash loan bank business stocks forbes income",
  "guide.problem.money.what": "Your save can look rich on paper while still being short on usable cash.",
  "guide.problem.money.why": "Loans, staff, production costs, stock positions, and business operations all hit cash flow differently.",
  "guide.problem.money.now1": "Check Bank before committing to new weekly payments.",
  "guide.problem.money.now2": "Use Forbes to understand net worth, not just cash.",
  "guide.problem.money.now3": "Use Stocks only when you can afford risk and wait for outcomes.",
  "guide.problem.awards.title": "Awards, IMDb, or release results feel unclear",
  "guide.problem.awards.subtitle": "Track where nominations, wins, ratings, box office, and news actually update.",
  "guide.problem.awards.search": "award imdb nomination winner release streaming box office rating",
  "guide.problem.awards.what": "Awards and release outcomes can update across ceremony, inventory, IMDb, news, and box office views.",
  "guide.problem.awards.why": "The game separates event drama from the permanent records so results can be shown in the right app after the event resolves.",
  "guide.problem.awards.now1": "Check IMDb for the project record and award history.",
  "guide.problem.awards.now2": "Check Box Office for release performance and lifecycle.",
  "guide.problem.awards.now3": "Check News for public reaction and media framing.",
  "guide.problem.relationships.title": "Relationships or dating are not making sense",
  "guide.problem.relationships.subtitle": "Understand dating apps, bonds, intimacy feedback, and relationship pressure.",
  "guide.problem.relationships.search": "relationship dating luxe tinder love intimacy family friend",
  "guide.problem.relationships.what": "Relationship systems react to compatibility, timing, bond strength, and life context.",
  "guide.problem.relationships.why": "Dating, intimacy, family, friendship, career stress, and public attention can all pull the relationship in different directions.",
  "guide.problem.relationships.now1": "Use Luxe or Tinder when you are actively looking for a match.",
  "guide.problem.relationships.now2": "Use Social when you want to maintain existing bonds.",
  "guide.problem.relationships.now3": "Read intimacy and pregnancy feedback as outcome messaging, not always a relationship failure.",
  "guide.problem.studio.title": "Studio, sequels, or universes feel complex",
  "guide.problem.studio.subtitle": "Separate scripts, greenlight, production, connected characters, and releases.",
  "guide.problem.studio.search": "studio production sequel prequel reboot spin-off universe greenlight script",
  "guide.problem.studio.what": "Studio work is a pipeline: idea, script, greenlight, package, production, release, and catalog impact.",
  "guide.problem.studio.why": "Sequels, reboots, spin-offs, and shared universes need extra continuity decisions because they reuse audience memory.",
  "guide.problem.studio.now1": "Name and shape the project before treating it like a real production.",
  "guide.problem.studio.now2": "Use IMDb and Box Office to review existing title history before extending a franchise.",
  "guide.problem.studio.now3": "Keep scripts moving only when cash, cast, and release timing support it.",
