  "services.x.generalPost": "Just had the best coffee of my life. \u2615 || Does anyone else feel like today is going to be great? || Reading scripts all day. \u{1F4D6} || LA traffic is a personality trait at this point. || Set life is the best life. \u{1F3AC} || Cinema is back. || Just watched a masterpiece. No spoilers.",
  "services.x.newsPost": "BREAKING: Studio execs hinting at a massive merger. || Box Office Update: Numbers are looking strong for the summer slate. || Rumor has it a certain A-Lister is walking away from their franchise. || Streaming services announced price hikes again. \u{1F4C9} || Award season predictions are already heating up.",
  "services.x.universePost": "I'm calling it right now, the next {universeName} movie is going to break records. || Who else is staying up till 3AM to watch the new {universeName} trailer drop? || If they do not bring back the original cast for {universeName}, we riot. || Can we talk about the post-credits scene in the latest {universeName} film? || The casting for the new {universeName} villain is absolutely perfect.",
  "services.x.industry.reply": "This is exactly why I keep X open during release weeks. || The trades are going to chase this all day. || This is the kind of update that changes the whole slate conversation. || Need the full numbers before everyone starts arguing.",
  "services.x.industry.quote": "Big week for the industry timeline. || This has more business impact than people think. || Bookmarking this for awards season. || The replies are already moving like a press room.",
  "services.x.industry.popPulse": "Entertainment X is busy today: casting chatter, release-date rumors, and fans trying to connect every tiny clue. || Pop culture timeline is awake again. A few studio moves are starting to look bigger than normal. || A new wave of film and series announcements is starting to shape the week.",
  "services.x.industry.streamingRelease": "{title} is gaining streaming traction with an audience score around {score}/100 and roughly {views} total views reported in-game.",
  "services.x.industry.billionGross": "{title} has crossed {gross} worldwide, putting it in rare box-office territory for this run.",
  "services.x.industry.boxOfficeRun": "{title} keeps building at the box office, now sitting near {gross} worldwide as weekend tracking stays hot.",
  "services.x.industry.awardWin": "{project} wins {category} at {award}. Awards chatter is immediately turning into legacy talk.",
  "services.x.industry.awardNomination": "{project} lands a {category} nomination at {award}. The campaign just got louder.",
  "services.x.industry.awardsCalendar": "{title} is next on the awards calendar. Expect predictions, snubs discourse, and last-minute campaign noise.",
  "services.x.industry.renewalBuzz": "Renewal watch: {title} is still part of the conversation after its latest season performance.",
  "services.x.industry.sequelBuzz": "Franchise watch: {title} is keeping sequel talk alive after the latest audience and studio signals.",
  "services.x.industry.studioSlate": "{studio} currently has {count} active project(s) moving through the slate. Studio watchers are paying attention.",
  "services.x.reply": "The timeline needed this context. || Film Twitter is already debating this. || Someone in PR just opened the group chat. || This is going to age interestingly.",
  "services.x.quote": "This explains a lot. || People are not ready for this conversation. || Bookmarking this for later. || The industry is moving weird today.",
