  "life.event.relationship.breakingPoint.marriage.description": "{partner} is done pretending the relationship can survive endless stress, public heat, and half-truths. Lawyers are now a real possibility.",
  "life.event.relationship.breakingPoint.partner.description": "{partner} says the relationship feels unstable, reactive, and embarrassing. They want one clear reason to stay.",
