  "life.event.relationship.breakingPoint.publicWar.description": "Short-term buzz, long-term damage.",
  "life.event.relationship.breakingPoint.publicWar.log": "You chose spectacle over peace. The internet is entertained. Your life is not.",
  "life.event.relationship.exReturn.title": "The Ex Resurfaces",
  "life.event.relationship.exReturn.description": '{ex} reappears with one perfectly timed message just as things with {partner} were finally steady. They want to "clear the air."',
