  "services.news.industry.trend": "Studio executives report 'franchise fatigue' among younger audiences. || Streaming wars intensify as platforms bid for exclusive rights. || Critics declare the Age of the Movie Star is returning. || Studios quietly shift more projects toward mid-budget thrillers. || Merchandising revenue is becoming a deciding factor in sequel greenlights.",
  "services.news.industry.npc": "{name} attached to star in upcoming biopic. || {name} exits project due to creative differences. || Rumors swirl around {name} casting in superhero franchise. || {name} sparks awards chatter after private industry screening. || {name} becomes the subject of intense recasting speculation.",
  "services.news.release.hit.headline": "'{title}' dominates the box office for a second week. || Audiences flock to '{title}', defying analyst predictions. || '{title}' becomes a cultural phenomenon. || '{title}' turns strong buzz into undeniable box office power. || '{title}' now looks like the breakout hit studios were waiting for.",
  "services.news.release.hit.universeHeadline": "'{title}' proves the cinematic universe is stronger than ever. || Fans are calling '{title}' the best entry in the franchise yet. || Box office explodes as '{title}' expands the universe lore. || '{title}' sets up the next major crossover event perfectly.",
  "services.news.release.flop.headline": "'{title}' stumbles out of the gate with weak opening. || Budget concerns loom as '{title}' underperforms. || Marketing misfire blamed for '{title}' disappointment. || Audience indifference leaves '{title}' in dangerous territory. || Studio optimism fades as '{title}' fails to catch fire.",
  "services.news.release.flop.universeHeadline": "Is franchise fatigue setting in? '{title}' underperforms. || '{title}' fails to capture the magic of previous universe entries. || Fans disappointed by '{title}', questioning the universe direction. || A rare misstep for the franchise as '{title}' bombs at the box office.",
  "services.news.release.criticLoved.headline": "Critics hail '{title}' as a modern masterpiece. || '{title}' generates early Oscar buzz. || '{title}' is the critical darling of the season. || Reviewers say '{title}' overdelivers on nearly every front.",
  "services.news.release.criticLoved.universeHeadline": "Critics praise '{title}' for elevating the entire franchise. || '{title}' proves superhero movies can be high art. || A masterclass in world-building: '{title}' stuns reviewers. || '{title}' balances fan service with a gripping narrative.",
  "services.news.release.criticHated.headline": "Critics tear apart '{title}' for weak script. || '{title}' branded a confused mess by top reviewers. || Style over substance: '{title}' fails to impress. || '{title}' is being called overproduced, underwritten, and forgettable.",
  "services.news.release.criticHated.universeHeadline": "Critics pan '{title}' as a soulless cash grab. || '{title}' relies too heavily on cameos, ignoring the plot. || A confusing mess of lore: '{title}' alienates casual viewers. || Reviewers say '{title}' is a sign the universe has lost its way.",
  "services.news.sequel.hype.headline": "Fans demand a sequel to '{title}' on social media. || Online buzz grows around possible '{title}' cinematic universe. || Audiences want more from the '{title}' world. || Speculation mounts over '{title}' follow-up. || Trade analysts say '{title}' is exactly the kind of hit that becomes a series.",
  "services.news.sequel.confirmed.headline": "IT'S OFFICIAL: Studio greenlights '{title}' sequel. || '{title} 2' is happening! Pre-production starts soon. || Studio confirms return to the world of '{title}'. || Franchise alert! '{title}' sequel officially announced.",
  "services.news.scandal.headline": "BREAKING: {name} caught in a whirlwind of controversy. || Is this the end for {name}? New allegations surface. || Social media erupts as {name}'s past comes to light. || Public opinion of {name} takes a sharp dive. || {name}'s team scrambles to contain a fast-moving PR disaster.",
  "services.news.legal.headline": "Legal battle looms for {name} as court date set. || Inside the courtroom: {name}'s high-stakes legal drama. || Will {name} settle? Experts weigh in on the ongoing case. || A blow to {name}'s career as legal troubles mount. || {name}'s legal team signals an aggressive defense strategy.",
