  "dating.tinder.chat.smallTalk.0": "Hey, \xBFc\xF3mo va realmente tu semana?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.smallTalk.1": "You seem fun. What's the story?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.smallTalk.2": "What are you doing when you're not pretending to answer messages?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.smallTalk.3": "What does a calm week look like in your world?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.smallTalk.4": "You feel like someone who disappears into fun plans. True?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.deepTalk.0": "\xBFQu\xE9 es algo que la gente siempre entiende mal de ti?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.deepTalk.1": "What are you actually chasing right now?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.deepTalk.2": "What would make this year feel worth it for you?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.deepTalk.3": "You seem too polished to be boring. What's under that?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.deepTalk.4": "What kind of person gets the real version of you?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.playful.0": "Scale of 1 to reckless, how bad of an idea are you?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.playful.1": "Serious question. Are you charming on purpose or is it accidental?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.playful.2": "Tell me one red flag you somehow make look good.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.playful.3": "What chaos level are you bringing if we hang out?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.playful.4": "You look like trouble, but the entertaining kind.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtCompliment.0": "Eres un poco peligrosamente lindo.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtCompliment.1": "I was going to play it cool, but that is not happening.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtCompliment.2": "You look like a bad decision I would absolutely make.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtCompliment.3": "You have no business being this easy to stare at.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtCompliment.4": "You look like the kind of person people write songs about.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtHeatCheck.0": "If I made the first move in person, would that ruin your composure?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtHeatCheck.1": "I feel like subtle is wasted on us.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtHeatCheck.2": "You and I would either click instantly or become a disaster. I'm curious.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtHeatCheck.3": "Tell me if I'm reading this wrong, but the tension feels very real.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.flirtHeatCheck.4": "If we met in person, I feel like subtlety would lose fast.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.date.0": "Dejemos de escribirnos y vayamos por unas copas.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.date.1": "You free this week? Let's do coffee or something dangerous.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.date.2": "Come out with me. We can see if this is real.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.date.3": "I know a fun little spot. You in?",
  "dating.tinder.chat.date.4": "We should meet before the vibe disappears.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.casualKeepCasual.0": "No pressure. We can keep this easy and just have fun.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.casualKeepCasual.1": "Let's not overcomplicate this. Just chemistry and good timing.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.casualKeepCasual.2": "We don't need a label to enjoy this.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.casualKeepCasual.3": "I like this better when it stays light.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.casualKeepCasual.4": "Let's keep it casual and see where it goes.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.casualLateNight.0": "Come through later. No speeches, just a vibe.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.casualLateNight.1": "Let's steal a late-night hour and keep this between us.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.casualLateNight.2": "After midnight feels more our speed.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.casualLateNight.3": "You free late? I want a version of this with less daylight and more tension.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.official.0": "I don't want this to stay random. Let's be real about it.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.official.1": "I like you enough to stop pretending this is casual.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.official.2": "I want to date you properly.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.official.3": "Let's make this official.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.official.4": "I think we've crossed out of app territory.",
  "dating.tinder.chat.hookupPlayer": "Come over. Let's stop pretending this is innocent.",
  "dating.tinder.response.match.0": "Ok, me gusta tu energ\xEDa.",
  "dating.tinder.response.match.1": "Haha, that's actually cute.",
