  "luxe.chat.smallTalk.label": "Charla ligera",
  "luxe.chat.smallTalk.line.0": "Tienes gustos caros. Lo respeto.",
  "luxe.chat.smallTalk.line.1": "What does a calm week look like in your world?",
  "luxe.chat.smallTalk.line.2": "You seem too polished to be boring.",
  "luxe.chat.smallTalk.line.3": "Tell me something real that never makes it into interviews.",
  "luxe.chat.smallTalk.line.4": "What kind of places make you actually want to stay longer than five minutes?",
  "luxe.chat.smallTalk.line.5": "I feel like your profile is leaving out the interesting part on purpose.",
  "luxe.chat.deepTalk.label": "Deep Talk",
  "luxe.chat.deepTalk.line.0": "\xBFQu\xE9 parte de tu vida todav\xEDa se siente real cuando todo lo dem\xE1s es una actuaci\xF3n?",
  "luxe.chat.deepTalk.line.1": "When people talk about you, what do they always get wrong?",
  "luxe.chat.deepTalk.line.2": "What are you still chasing even after all this success?",
  "luxe.chat.deepTalk.line.3": "What kind of person actually gets past your public armor?",
  "luxe.chat.deepTalk.line.4": "What do you protect most fiercely these days?",
  "luxe.chat.deepTalk.line.5": "Has fame made you softer, colder, or just harder to surprise?",
  "luxe.chat.careerTalk.label": "Hablar de carrera",
  "luxe.chat.careerTalk.line.0": "Tell me what you are building right now that people still underestimate.",
  "luxe.chat.careerTalk.line.1": "What move are you making next that nobody sees coming?",
  "luxe.chat.careerTalk.line.2": "You strike me as someone who plays a very long game.",
  "luxe.chat.careerTalk.line.3": "What kind of legacy are you actually interested in leaving behind?",
  "luxe.chat.careerTalk.line.4": "Which room still excites you when you walk into it?",
  "luxe.chat.careerTalk.line.5": "What project are you waiting for the world to catch up to?",
  "luxe.flirt.tease.label": "Tease",
  "luxe.flirt.tease.line.0": "Pareces una muy mala idea de la mejor forma posible.",
  "luxe.flirt.tease.line.1": "You have the kind of face that starts expensive problems.",
  "luxe.flirt.tease.line.2": "You seem suspiciously aware of your own effect on people.",
  "luxe.flirt.tease.line.3": "You definitely enjoy being trouble.",
  "luxe.flirt.tease.line.4": "You are either a masterpiece or a warning sign.",
  "luxe.flirt.tease.line.5": "This level of charm usually comes with fine print.",
  "luxe.flirt.compliment.label": "Compliment",
  "luxe.flirt.compliment.line.0": "You wear status well. Most people cannot pull that off.",
  "luxe.flirt.compliment.line.1": "You have a very unfair amount of presence.",
  "luxe.flirt.compliment.line.2": "You make confidence look effortless.",
  "luxe.flirt.compliment.line.3": "There is something dangerously elegant about your whole energy.",
  "luxe.flirt.compliment.line.4": "You have the kind of face people remember in the wrong moments.",
  "luxe.flirt.compliment.line.5": "You somehow manage to look both unreachable and inviting.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.label": "Turn Up Heat",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.0": "You and I would either become iconic or scandalous.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.1": "I can already tell the gossip blogs would hate us.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.2": "The chemistry here feels more expensive than it should.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.3": "If we meet in person, subtlety probably dies first.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.4": "This is starting to feel like the kind of mistake I would enjoy.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.5": "You seem like the sort of person who ruins self-control on contact.",
  "luxe.response.warm.0": "Eso fue m\xE1s suave de lo que esperaba.",
  "luxe.response.warm.1": "You might actually be interesting.",
  "luxe.response.warm.2": "I like this energy.",
  "luxe.response.warm.3": "Keep going. I am listening.",
  "luxe.response.cool.0": "Bold.",
  "luxe.response.cool.1": "Maybe.",
  "luxe.response.cool.2": "Convince me.",
  "luxe.response.cool.3": "You are trying. I appreciate the effort.",
