  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.0": "You and I would either become iconic or scandalous.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.1": "I can already tell the gossip blogs would hate us.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.2": "The chemistry here feels more expensive than it should.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.3": "If we meet in person, subtlety probably dies first.",
  "luxe.flirt.turnUpHeat.line.4": "This is starting to feel like the kind of mistake I would enjoy.",
